<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#171717;">- Mehdi</p>', 'Hey, Mehdi here. I built BetterFlag.

